# Cloudflare Pages/Workers static-asset headers. Filenames here aren't
# content-hashed, so this trades a bounded staleness window (up to an
# hour) for letting repeat page views skip the network entirely instead
# of re-fetching/revalidating every asset on every navigation.
/*.wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate
